  "scope": "The positive solvable exponents form an upper interval. For zero-threshold data and any existing exact solution sequence with exponent tending to zero, the scalar and total mass tend to zero, with uniform exponential and unnormalized-potential collapse. The tailored S03 density supplies existence; normalized-potential convergence and general classification remain open.",
